  "story": {
    "premise": "The equivocation is isolated, the whole-city geometry is restored, and the correction fragments are ordered. Yet the retained archive jumps directly from sealed heat to a public route outcome. The hearing permits at most two latent events, but an explanation is acceptable only if every proper subset fails.",
    "submission": "Inject exactly the field sensor report and the surface route commitment it caused. Bind the resulting safe contract; the verifier independently replays the empty explanation and both one-event explanations.",
    "diagnostics": "A self-justifying route, an uncited sensor report, extra inventions, or either event alone fails the minimality contract even if the full branch looks plausible.",
    "hints": [
      "One event establishes the physical fact.",
      "The other records the policy consequence.",
      "Minimal means testing what remains after each event is removed."
